+## Billing settings
+
+The billing settings module (`src/billing.js`) validates a plan, seat count, and
+optional email and renders a settings page response.
+
+- `validateBillingSettings(settings)` -> `{ valid, errors }`
+- `renderBillingSettingsPage(settings)` -> `{ status, body }` (200 when valid, 400 otherwise)
+
+Valid plans: `free`, `pro`, `enterprise`. `seats` must be a positive integer.
+
 ## Develop
 
 ```bash
diff --git a/src/billing.js b/src/billing.js
